  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is very pursuasive. [PAWN_pronoun] finds it relatively easy to rally people under [PAWN_pronoun] banner. -->
  <RT_TalentRecruiter.degreeDatas.colord4af37Talent_Recruitercolor.description>[PAWN_nameDef]很有追求。[pawn_pronoun]觉得殖民地打着[pawn_pronoun]的旗号会比较容易凝聚人心。</RT_TalentRecruiter.degreeDatas.colord4af37Talent_Recruitercolor.description>
  
  <!-- EN: <color=#d4af37>Talent: Scout</color> -->
