  <!-- EN: [PAWN_nameDef] is an expert at scouting out new locations. [PAWN_pronoun] frequently leave the relative safety of the colony to patrol the wilderness. -->
  <RT_TalentScout.degreeDatas.colord4af37Talent_Scoutcolor.description>[PAWN_nameDef]是一个侦察新地点的专家。[PAWN_pronoun]经常离开相对安全的殖民地去野外巡逻。</RT_TalentScout.degreeDatas.colord4af37Talent_Scoutcolor.description>
  
